Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; ============================================================
; Disable Widgets (Win11 Taskbar Weather/News)
; Windows 11 Gaming Optimization Guide
; Source: FR33THYFR33THY/Ultimate — 6 Windows/8 Widgets.ps1
; Copyright FR33THY (MIT)
; ============================================================
; Tier: Advanced (UI debloat, no functional risk)
;
; Disables the Widgets pane on the taskbar (the weather/news icon).
; Removes the polling background process and stops the news fetches.
;
; Pair: revert-widgets.reg
; ============================================================

; --- Hide widgets icon on taskbar (per-user) ---
[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Explorer\Advanced]
"TaskbarDa"=dword:00000000

; --- Disable widgets system-wide via policy (machine) ---
[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Policies\Microsoft\Dsh]
"AllowNewsAndInterests"=dword:00000000

; --- Block the Windows Widgets app from running ---
[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\PolicyManager\default\NewsAndInterests\AllowNewsAndInterests]
"value"=dword:00000000
